# Butler Routes - Badlands (Horde) Recipes companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Every recipe with a source physically in the Badlands for a Horde player:
# vendor-sold in-zone, or narrow sole-dropper kills. Run it in its own Polestar
# tab at the end of the core route or standalone. EVERY goal is optional and
# every goal in a learnable profession rides a when-skill gate; a recipe the
# character cannot learn yet is skipped, never blocking. Every vendor buy
# carries an npc pin to the exact in-zone vendor. Spawn points and sources
# are the local Forever game data. Professions with no in-zone Horde source
# (Alchemy, Cooking, Fishing, Leatherworking) say so plainly in notes rather
# than staying silent.
guide butler-routes-completionist/badlands-horde-recipes
title Badlands (Horde) - Recipes
levels 30-40
zone Badlands
faction Horde
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords badlands, recipes, companions, horde
coords live
version 1

step Far south-west vendor - Yuka's stock (Engineering)

  zone map 1418

  when skill Engineering 1

  tip Yuka Screwspigot (npc 9544) at (4.90, 94.70), far south-west, sells the schematic.
  buy 10602 "Schematic: Deadly Scope" npc 9544
  note Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).
  note No quest takes it; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Kargath-area vendor - Jazzrik's stock (Blacksmithing)

  zone map 1418

  when skill Blacksmithing 1

  tip Jazzrik (npc 9179) at (42.47, 52.50), Blacksmithing Supplies in Kargath, sells the plans.
  buy 10858 "Plans: Solid Iron Maul" npc 9179
  note Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).
  note No quest takes it; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step East - hard gold coif (Blacksmithing)

  zone map 1418

  when skill Blacksmithing 1

  loop

  goto 64.36,23.75
  goto 65.52,22.05
  goto 65.66,23.49
  goto 67.13,22.09
  goto 68.08,25.08
  collect 251389 "Plans: Hard Gold Coif" optional
  note The Dustbelcher Warrior (level 36) in the east is the sole dropper anywhere in the data. No quest takes it.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

